      <string id="Console_RecordingIncludeDetails">Show the connection's details in recordings</string>
      <string id="Console_RecordingIncludeDetails_Help">Fixes this setting of RemoteHub on this PC. It is greyed out in Settings → Recordings and users can't change it.

Enabled: recordings include the tab's header with the connection's name and address.

Disabled: recordings show only the session.

Not configured: the user decides (default: off).

Registry: RecordingIncludeDetails (REG_DWORD) = 1 or 0.</string>

      <string id="Console_ProcessRefreshSeconds">Refresh the processes tab every</string>
      <string id="Console_ProcessRefreshSeconds_Help">Fixes this setting of RemoteHub on this PC. It is greyed out in Global defaults → Remote tools and users can't change it.

Enabled: the value set here (seconds, 0 = only by hand).

Disabled or Not configured: the user decides (default: 15 seconds).

Registry: ProcessRefreshSeconds (REG_DWORD), 0–3600.</string>

      <string id="Console_ServiceRefreshSeconds">Refresh the services tab every</string>
