      <string id="Console_TaskRefreshSeconds">Refresh the scheduled tasks tab every</string>
      <string id="Console_TaskRefreshSeconds_Help">Fixes this setting of RemoteHub on this PC. It is greyed out in Global defaults → Remote tools and users can't change it.

Enabled: the value set here (seconds, 0 = only by hand).

