      <string id="Console_ConnPsUseSsl">PowerShell remoting over HTTPS</string>
      <string id="Console_ConnPsUseSsl_Help">Fixes this setting for every connection on this PC. It wins over the global defaults, the folders and the connection, which keep their own value but don't use it; the connection editor shows it greyed out at every level. A settings file shared with PCs without this policy keeps working there as before.

